{% extends "base.html.twig" %}

{% block title %}Lesson 8: Understanding AI Recommendations{% endblock %}

{% block body %}
<style>
    :root {
        --bg-dark: #0a0f1c;
        --card-bg: rgba(20, 27, 45, 0.6);
        --card-border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
        --accent: #6366f1; /* Indigo for AI data */
        --accent-glow: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.4);
        --text-main: #f8fafc;
        --text-muted: #94a3b8;
    }

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { 
        background: var(--bg-dark); 
        color: var(--text-main);
        font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.6;
        overflow-x: hidden;
    }
    
    h1, h2, h3 { font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif; }

    .top-progress-container {
        position: fixed;
        top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 4px;
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
        z-index: 1000;
    }
    .top-progress-fill {
        height: 100%;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, #6366f1, #8b5cf6);
        width: 88.88%; /* Lesson 8/9 */
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--accent-glow);
    }

    .container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 60px 20px; }

    .glass-card {
        background: var(--card-bg);
        backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
        border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 40px;
        margin-bottom: 30px;
        box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        animation: fadeUp 0.8s ease-out forwards;
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(20px);
    }
    
    .glass-card:nth-child(1) { animation-delay: 0.1s; }
    .glass-card:nth-child(2) { animation-delay: 0.2s; }

    @keyframes fadeUp {
        to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    .lesson-header h1 {
        font-size: 36px;
        margin-bottom: 15px;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff, #c7d2fe);
        -webkit-background-clip: text;
        -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }

    .meta-tags { display: flex; gap: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .tag {
        background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
        padding: 6px 14px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: var(--text-muted);
        border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    }
    .tag-accent {
        background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.15);
        color: #a5b4fc;
        border-color: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);
    }

    .model-container {
        width: 100%;
        height: 600px;
        border-radius: 16px;
        overflow: hidden;
        position: relative;
        background: #050810;
        border: 1px solid var(--card-border);
        margin: 30px 0;
        box-shadow: inset 0 0 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);
    }

    .model-overlay {
        position: absolute;
        top: 20px; left: 20px;
        pointer-events: none;
    }
    .model-title {
        color: #fff;
        font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
    }

    .content-area h2 { color: #fff; font-size: 24px; margin: 30px 0 15px; }
    .content-area p { color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 16px; }
    .content-area ul { list-style: none; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .content-area li {
        color: var(--text-muted);
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        padding-left: 24px;
        position: relative;
    }
    .content-area li::before {
        content: '→';
        position: absolute;
        left: 0;
        color: var(--accent);
    }

    .highlight-box {
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(99,102,241,0.1), transparent);
        border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0;
        margin: 25px 0;
    }
    .highlight-box strong { color: #fff; }

    .navigation { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 20px; margin-top: 40px; }
    .btn {
        padding: 16px 32px; border-radius: 12px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none;
        text-align: center; transition: all 0.3s; cursor: pointer; border: none; font-size: 16px;
    }
    .btn-prev { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); color: #fff; border: 1px solid var(--card-border); }
    .btn-prev:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }
    .btn-complete { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6366f1, #4f46e5); color: white; flex-grow: 1; }
    .btn-complete:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 10px 20px -10px rgba(99,102,241,0.6); }
    .btn-next { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2); color: white; }
    .btn-next:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 10px 20px -10px rgba(102,126,234,0.6); }

    @media (max-width: 768px) { .navigation { flex-direction: column; } .model-container { height: 400px; } }
</style>

<script src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js"></script>
<script src="/js/three-sensor-models.js"></script>

<div class="top-progress-container"><div class="top-progress-fill"></div></div>

<div class="container">
    <div class="glass-card lesson-header">
        <div class="meta-tags">
            <span class="tag">⏱️ 18 min read</span>
            <span class="tag">📈 Level: Advanced</span>
            <span class="tag tag-accent">🤖 AI Integration</span>
        </div>
        <h1>Understanding AI Recommendations</h1>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 18px;">Discover how the SmartFarm platform synthesizes millions of data points to give you actionable daily tasks.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="glass-card content-area">
        <div id="model-viewer" class="model-container" data-sensor="ai">
            <div class="model-overlay">
                <div class="model-title">Neural Network Data Flow</div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <h2>The Recommendation Engine</h2>
        <p>The AI recommendation engine doesn't just look at one sensor. It aggregates data from your humidity, temperature, pH, and NPK sensors, combines it with local weather forecasts, and compares it against historical crop models.</p>

        <div class="highlight-box">
            <strong>💡 Predictive vs. Reactive:</strong> A traditional system warns you *after* the soil is dry. The SmartFarm AI predicts that your soil *will be* dry by 2 PM based on the morning temperature spike and wind speed, recommending irrigation at 1 PM to prevent stress.
        </div>

        <h2>Types of Recommendations</h2>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Irrigation Optimization:</strong> Exact gallon/liter amounts and exact times of day to water, minimizing evaporation.</li>
            <li><strong>Fertilizer Dosing:</strong> Precise NPK mixture ratios needed to correct an impending deficiency before symptoms appear.</li>
            <li><strong>Harvest Timing:</strong> Forecasting the optimal harvest window based on accumulated growing degree days (GDD).</li>
        </ul>
        
        <h2>Feedback Loops</h2>
        <p>When you mark an AI recommendation as "Completed" in the app, the system learns. If it recommended 10 liters of water, and the soil humidity sensor records the exact optimal moisture level an hour later, the AI reinforces that model. Over time, it creates a custom behavioral model specifically for your farm's unique soil profile.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="navigation">
        <a href="/lesson/7" class="btn btn-prev">← Previous</a>
        <button class="btn btn-complete" onclick="completeLesson(8, this)">
            <span class="btn-text">✓ Mark as Complete</span>
        </button>
        <a href="/lesson/9" class="btn btn-next">Next Lesson →</a>
    </div>
</div>

<script>
    function completeLesson(lessonNumber, btn) {
        const btnText = btn.querySelector('.btn-text');
        btnText.innerText = 'Saving...';
        
        fetch(`/lesson/complete/${lessonNumber}`, { method: 'POST' })
            .then(r => r.json())
            .then(data => {
                btnText.innerText = 'Completed! 🎉';
                btn.style.background = 'linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669)';
                setTimeout(() => window.location.href = `/lesson/${lessonNumber + 1}`, 1000);
            })
            .catch(err => {
                console.error('Error:', err);
                btnText.innerText = 'Error saving';
            });
    }
</script>
{% endblock %}
